---

### Bottom line  

The **Energy‑Pump + Fine‑grained dead‑zone** policy above keeps the best ideas from the earlier attempts, removes the stall/overshoot bugs, and should raise the average reward from ~‑80 to well below ‑70 (closer to the reward‑threshold of ‑100).  Implement it as the new controller and evaluate over the next 10‑15 episodes; if the success rate climbs above 50 % you have a solid baseline for further fine‑tuning.
